{'author': 'Alex Wilms',
 'description': "LinOTP two-factor authentication server monitoring via its "
                "API - token counts and per-resolver user counts per realm "
                "with configurable levels, storage encryption, config sync, "
                "and license & support status including LinOTP's "
                "grace-limit message.",
